# psi/test_espc.py Window's manipulator screens (SHOT_PINS['reshaped'],
# docs/simpos/screens/manipulator_reshape.png; Window.manip_events):
# Login PIMOS from the system menu (window 1); window 2 by create/kill's
# pop-up and a sweep of two corners; then the middle button on window 2
# opens the manipulator, RESHAPE, and two corners (100, 100), (500, 300).
# Left clicks wait 500 ms apart, so that none makes a double (mouse#ll).
click r 640 560
click r 640 560
click l 978 605
quiet
# window 2: the system menu at (200, 150), its create/kill pop-up item,
# `create`, and the sweep's two corners
click r 200 150
click r 200 150
click l 500 195
wait 500
click l 540 220
wait 500
click l 600 500
wait 500
click l 1000 640
quiet
# the manipulator on window 2 (the middle button), RESHAPE (item 2)
click m 620 560
click l 700 620
wait 500
click l 100 100
quiet
moveto 300 250
quiet
click l 500 300
quiet
